menu "FieldProof contact observer"

config FIELDPROOF_CONTACT_GPIO
    int "Read-only dry-contact input GPIO"
    range 0 23
    default 9
    help
        GPIO9 reads the BOOT button in the existing demonstration.
        An external dry contact needs a verified board pin and ground wiring.
        Supported chip pins are 0, 1, 2, 3, 6, 7, 9, and 18 through 23.
        Other pins fail compilation. Do not connect a powered output.

endmenu
